WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.620
From the watch list
on the Monitor tab,

2
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.630
click the underlying
symbol you wish to

3
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.700
create your options
strangled tried for.

4
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:26.190
As long as your tabs are part
of the same Windows group,

5
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.580
the underlying will appear
in the order entry panel.

6
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.965
To the right of the
order entry panel,

7
00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:35.475
select a strategy builder
from the dropdown menu.

8
00:00:35.475 --> 00:00:37.800
To the lower left
of the strategy,

9
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.745
Build a window, ensure
the on button is active.

10
00:00:41.745 --> 00:00:45.375
If not, just click
it to activate.

11
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.870
Above you will see the
option chain window

12
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:49.370
populate with calls to

13
00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:51.140
the left and put to the right of

14
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:53.990
the strike column in the
middle of the display.

15
00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.780
Use the tabs above the call area

16
00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.765
to locate different
expiration dates.

17
00:00:59.765 --> 00:01:01.835
Above the put display,

18
00:01:01.835 --> 00:01:03.860
use the strikes dropdown to

19
00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:06.845
fine tune the contracts
displayed on screen.

20
00:01:06.845 --> 00:01:09.755
You will see the price
and daily change of the

21
00:01:09.755 --> 00:01:12.965
underlying to the upper
right of the window.

22
00:01:12.965 --> 00:01:14.720
Strategy builder has

23
00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.910
several predefined
option combinations

24
00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.370
available from the
strategy dropdown menu

25
00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.730
to the lower right of the screen.

26
00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:25.560
Reveal the list by clicking
on the dropdown menu.

27
00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.800
Select Strangle from the list,

28
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.350
and notice the icon shown
in the lower part of

29
00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.180
the display instructing you to

30
00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:35.045
click on a leg to
display the strangle.

31
00:01:35.045 --> 00:01:37.130
Notice that when the cursor is

32
00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.065
placed above the bid
price of a call,

33
00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.120
the software
automatically highlights

34
00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.305
the pertinent element for
the rest of the combination.

35
00:01:44.305 --> 00:01:46.335
For a short strangle,

36
00:01:46.335 --> 00:01:49.090
TWS knows that sending
a call requires

37
00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:53.135
the sale of a lower strike
put at the same expiration.

38
00:01:53.135 --> 00:01:56.400
Hence, both legs display in red.

39
00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.310
Move the cursor above the
Ask Price on a call and see

40
00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.510
the related leg on

41
00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.940
the put side also moves
to the ask price.

42
00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.530
Locate the desired
call strike you

43
00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:10.110
want to build your
short strangled for.

44
00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.460
Scroll the mouse
wheel up and you will

45
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.395
see the call leg remain static,

46
00:02:14.395 --> 00:02:17.555
but the put leg widen
to a lower strike.

47
00:02:17.555 --> 00:02:19.900
Scroll the mouse wheel down to

48
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.345
narrow the legs and
the combination.

49
00:02:22.345 --> 00:02:24.850
When you have correctly
defined both legs,

50
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:27.470
click on the bid price
for the call side to move

51
00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:31.490
both call and put legs down
to the strategy builder.

52
00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:33.920
Note that clicking
on the ask price

53
00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.365
would have generated
the long strangle.

54
00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:39.440
With both legs of the
short strangling position

55
00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.850
below the bid ask column,

56
00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.714
you will see the price
quote for the combination.

57
00:02:43.714 --> 00:02:47.030
This is the combined
price of both legs and in

58
00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:50.390
the case of the short
strangle represents a credit.

59
00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:52.250
Use the order entry panel at

60
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.850
the bottom of the page
to create your order.

61
00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:59.125
Define the quantity of strangle
combinations to trade,

62
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:02.240
choose the right order type
from the dropdown menu.

63
00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.085
If using a limit price,

64
00:03:04.085 --> 00:03:05.810
choose the value by clicking in

65
00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.340
the input field or simply
typing in the value.

66
00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.810
Select from the time
enforced dropdown,

67
00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:15.005
whether this is a day or
good till canceled order.

68
00:03:15.005 --> 00:03:17.660
Your order is ready to review.

69
00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.670
Click the "Submit" button to

70
00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.880
generate an order confirmation.

71
00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:26.090
When you have reviewed the
details, click "Transmit".

72
00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:28.070
The order is sent
for execution at

73
00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.510
the exchange and will appear

74
00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:33.125
in the activity panel to
the lower left of mosaic.

75
00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:36.650
To pause or interact
with an active order,

76
00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.465
click on it in the activity panel

77
00:03:38.465 --> 00:03:41.130
and make the relevant choice.